  "description": "UKAPAY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group C 2/c. Reported CIF formula moiety: C102 H114 Cl2 Nd4 O19 2+,2(C3 H7 N1 O1),2(Cl1 1-). From the CIF bond table, Nd1 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2 (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd1A (Nd) has 7 O neighbors; Nd2A (Nd) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with three-dimensional metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.622-4.053 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 90.56-118.01°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula [Nd4(Cl)2(O)(hpb)6]Cl2 · 2DMF.",
